    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30577" root="عمل" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِمْلَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A mode,</i> or <i>manner, of work, labour,</i> or
<i>service;</i> or of <i>doing,</i> or <i>acting;</i> or <i>of making.</i>
(K, TA.) One says <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ خَبِيثُ العِمْلَةِ</span>, meaning
<i>A man bad,</i> or <i>corrupt, in respect of</i> [<i>the mode
of</i>] <i>gain.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَمِلَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And see
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُمَالَةٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also The <i>internal state,</i> or <i>condition, of
a man, in relation to evil.</i> (K.)

